&gt;Solid underline: key. Dashed underline: partial key.&lt;br&gt;Triangle (ISA): subtypes; it points toward the subtypes.&lt;br&gt;Crow&#x27;s feet: two bars = exactly one; circle and bar = zero or one;&lt;br&gt;circle and crow&#x27;s foot = zero or many; bar and crow&#x27;s foot = one or many.&lt;br&gt;Grey: TRIAD contribution (authorship, revision, agent layer).&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Identifier&lt;/i&gt; = System + Value (composite, the FHIR Identifier).&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Address&lt;/i&gt; = Street, City, Region, PostalCode, Country (composite).&lt;br&gt;Dashed box: a copy of an entity from page 1." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2080" y="1440" width="600" height="252" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
